---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Team — Kineti"
  description="Who pays for Kineti and what they get: cap per repo, required ship-check, weekly receipt export."
>
  <section class="border-b border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-16 pb-8 sm:px-6 sm:pt-24">
      <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">Team</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">For the agency owner or eng manager who owns merge and the API card.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-line">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="border border-line bg-surface p-6">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-fg">WHO</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Agency owner or eng manager. You own the default branch and the monthly model spend band. 1–50 repos on GitHub or GitLab.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-line bg-surface p-6">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-fg">DELIVERABLE</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted marker:text-accent">
            <li>Cap per repo or per client (<code class="text-accent">[limits].global_usd</code> + <code class="text-accent">--cap</code> override)</li>
            <li><code class="text-accent">ship-check</code> required on default branch (GitHub Action / GitLab job — see <a href="/docs/ci" class="text-accent hover:underline">CI</a>)</li>
            <li>Weekly <code class="text-accent">receipt</code> export — file or email of <code class="text-accent">kineti receipt</code> JSON</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 border border-line bg-surface p-6">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-fg">NOT INCLUDED</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Replacing Claude/Cursor, AI Act certificate, 24/7 SLA, on-prem SSO. Kineti is a spend fuse + merge stamp around the agent you already use. See <a href="/security" class="text-accent hover:underline">Security</a> for honest limits.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 border border-accent bg-surface-2 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-fg">CONTACT</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">One email, no Intercom. Tell us name, company, number of repos, GitHub/GitLab, monthly model spend band.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          <a href="mailto:hello@getkineti.com?subject=Kineti%20Team%20setup&body=Name:%0ACompany:%0ARepos:%0AGitHub%2FGitLab:%0AMonthly%20model%20spend%20band:" class="inline-block rounded-none border border-accent bg-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-accent transition-colors hover:bg-surface">hello@getkineti.com →</a>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted">Also at <code class="text-accent">/.well-known/security.txt</code>.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Alias: <a href="/agencies" class="text-accent hover:underline">/agencies</a> redirects here.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
